        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50961B1",
          "quote": "Data Center                      $35,580       $30,771       $18,404      Up 16%      Up 93%",
          "text": "数据中心市场平台在Q4 FY25收入355.80亿美元，同比增长93%，环比增长16%，呈现强劲增长。",
          "value": 35580,
          "raw_number": "35,580",
          "unit": "USD million",
          "role": "support",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50961B1",
          "quote": "Graphics                            3,295         4,046         4,205    Down 19%    Down 22%",
          "text": "可报告分部中Graphics在Q4 FY25收入32.95亿美元，同比降22%、环比降19%，与数据中心增长不同步。",
          "value": 3295,
          "raw_number": "3,295",
          "unit": "USD million",
          "role": "caution",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50961B1",
          "quote": "Gaming                             2,544         3,279         2,865    Down 22%    Down 11%",
          "text": "游戏市场平台Q4 FY25收入25.44亿美元，同比降11%、环比降22%，为反证之一。",
          "value": 2544,
          "raw_number": "2,544",
          "unit": "USD million",
          "role": "caution",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50961B1",
          "quote": "Networking                            3,024           3,127           3,331      Down 3%      Down 9%",
          "text": "数据中心内Networking在Q4 FY25收入30.24亿美元，同比降9%、环比降3%，说明数据中心内部也并非全增长。",
          "value": 3024,
          "raw_number": "3,024",
          "unit": "USD million",
          "role": "caution",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50963B1",
          "quote": "Gaming revenue for the fourth quarter was down 11% from a year ago and down 22% sequentially, due to limited supply for both Blackwell and Ada GPUs.",
          "text": "游戏Q4同比降11%、环比降22%的原因是无Blackwell和Ada GPU供应有限，期间为Q4 FY25。",
          "value": null,
          "raw_number": "",
          "unit": "",
          "role": "caution",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50963B1",
          "quote": "Networking revenue was $3.0 billion, down 9% from a year ago and down 3% sequentially.",
          "text": "网络业务Q4收入约30亿美元，同比降9%、环比降3%，期间为Q4 FY25。",
          "value": 3,
          "raw_number": "3.0",
          "unit": "USD billion",
          "role": "caution",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50962B1",
          "quote": "Data Center                                          $115,186          $47,525        Up 142%",
          "text": "FY25全年数据中心收入1151.86亿美元，同比增长142%。",
          "value": 115186,
          "raw_number": "115,186",
          "unit": "USD million",
          "role": "support",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50962B1",
          "quote": "Gaming                                                  11,350           10,447         Up 9%",
          "text": "FY25全年游戏收入113.50亿美元，同比增9%，虽全年增长但Q4下滑，不能证明同步增长。",
          "value": 11350,
          "raw_number": "11,350",
          "unit": "USD million",
          "role": "caution",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50963B1",
          "quote": "Data Center revenue for the fourth quarter was a record, up 93% from a year ago and up 16% sequentially.",
          "text": "数据中心Q4创纪录，同比增93%、环比增16%，期间为Q4 FY25。",
          "value": null,
          "raw_number": "",
          "unit": "",
          "role": "support",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50961B1",
          "quote": "Revenue by Market Platform",
          "text": "原文按市场平台披露收入，包含Data Center、Gaming、Professional Visualization、Automotive、OEM and Other，可观察各平台表现。",
          "value": null,
          "raw_number": "",
          "unit": "",
          "role": "support",
          "status": "definition"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50963B1",
          "quote": "We delivered $11.0 billion of Blackwell architecture revenue in the fourth quarter of fiscal 2025",
          "text": "Blackwell架构Q4 FY25收入110亿美元，是数据中心增长的主要驱动之一。",
          "value": 11.0,
          "raw_number": "11.0",
          "unit": "USD billion",
          "role": "support",
          "status": "observed"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "P842A50961B1",
          "quote": "Total                            $39,331       $35,082       $22,103      Up 12%      Up 78%",
          "text": "Q4 FY25总营收393.31亿美元，同比增78%、环比增12%，整体受数据中心拉动。",
          "value": 39331,
          "raw_number": "39,331",
          "unit": "USD million",
          "role": "support",
          "status": "observed"
        }
      ],
